{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CgeZAJ7rS9Cg73sEC9vpK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Instructor for PHP\",\n  \"targetAudience\": \"Boutique CMS consulting company owners\",\n  \"technologies\": [\n    \"PHP\",\n    \"LLM APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, etc.)\",\n    \"Structured data extraction\",\n    \"Vector embeddings\",\n    \"RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)\",\n    \"Agent frameworks\",\n    \"Laravel integration\",\n    \"Symfony integration\"\n  ],\n  \"features\": [\n    \"Structured data extraction from unstructured content with validation\",\n    \"Multi-provider LLM inference with unified API\",\n    \"Batch processing and asynchronous inference\",\n    \"Vector embeddings and semantic search\",\n    \"Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) for content systems\",\n    \"Intelligent agent SDK with custom tools and workflows\",\n    \"Framework-native integration (Laravel & Symfony)\",\n    \"Content validation and automated error correction\",\n    \"Context-aware decision APIs\",\n    \"Custom LLM output processors\"\n  ],\n  \"applications\": [\n    \"Automated content extraction and normalization from diverse sources\",\n    \"Intelligent content tagging and categorization systems\",\n    \"AI-powered content recommendations and search\",\n    \"Automated content validation and quality assurance\",\n    \"Structured data migration between CMS platforms\",\n    \"Content summarization and metadata generation\",\n    \"Multi-language content processing and localization\",\n    \"Semantic search across content repositories\",\n    \"Intelligent content moderation and filtering\",\n    \"Custom content workflows with AI decision points\"\n  ],\n  \"description\": \"Instructor for PHP is a developer-friendly library that transforms how CMS consulting companies integrate AI capabilities into their client solutions. It solves the critical problem of converting messy, unstructured content into validated, structured data without writing boilerplate code. For boutique consultants, this means you can rapidly build intelligent content systems—from automated content extraction and normalization to AI-powered search and recommendations—while maintaining control through custom validation rules and multi-provider flexibility. Leverage it to differentiate your services: migrate legacy content efficiently, build smart content pipelines, implement semantic search, and add AI decision-making to content workflows. The framework-agnostic design and unified LLM API let you build once and deploy across Laravel or Symfony projects with minimal overhead.\",\n  \"code\": \"```php\\nuse Cognesy\\\\Instructor\\\\StructuredOutput;\\nuse Symfony\\\\Component\\\\Validator\\\\Constraints as Assert;\\n\\n// Define your content metadata structure\\nclass ContentMetadata {\\n    #[Assert\\\\NotBlank]\\n    public string $title;\\n    \\n    #[Assert\\\\Length(min: 10, max: 500)]\\n    public string $excerpt;\\n    \\n    #[Assert\\\\Choice(choices: ['blog', 'page', 'guide', 'news'])]\\n    public string $contentType;\\n    \\n    /** @var string[] */\\n    public array $tags;\\n    \\n    public int $estimatedReadTime;\\n}\\n\\n// Extract and validate metadata from raw content\\n$rawContent = \\\"\\\"\\\"Blog post: The Future of Headless CMS\\nA comprehensive guide exploring modern content architecture...\\n\\\"\\\"\\\";\\n\\n$metadata = (new StructuredOutput())\\n    ->withResponseClass(ContentMetadata::class)\\n    ->withMessages($rawContent)\\n    ->get();\\n\\n// Metadata is automatically validated against your rules\\necho \\\"Title: \\\" . $metadata->title;\\necho \\\"Type: \\\" . $metadata->contentType;\\necho \\\"Tags: \\\" . implode(\\\", \\\", $metadata->tags);\\n```\"\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":471,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":6271,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":878,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}